@startuml SEQ_04_MENGELOLA_KONDISI_ASET
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-04: Mengelola Kondisi Aset

actor       "Admin"                        as Admin
boundary    "Browser"                      as Browser
control     "InventarisController"   as Controller
entity      "Aset Model"             as ModelDA
entity      "RiwayatKondisi Model"         as ModelRK
database    "riwayat_kondisi"              as DB

== Update Kondisi Aset ==

Admin   -> Browser     : Klik "Update Kondisi", pilih kondisi baru + isi keterangan
Browser -> Controller  : POST /inventaris/aset/{id}/kondisi
Controller -> ModelDA  : Query aset
ModelDA -> DB          : SELECT aset WHERE id = {id}
DB      --> ModelDA    : Data aset
ModelDA --> Controller : Data aset
Controller -> ModelDA  : update({kondisi})
ModelDA -> DB          : UPDATE aset SET kondisi = ? WHERE id = {id}
DB      --> ModelDA    : Berhasil
Controller -> ModelRK  : create({aset_id, kondisi, keterangan})
ModelRK -> DB          : INSERT INTO riwayat_kondisi
DB      --> ModelRK    : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> Admin      : Badge kondisi aset ter-update

== Lihat Riwayat Kondisi ==

Admin   -> Browser     : Klik "Riwayat Kondisi" pada aset
Browser -> Controller  : GET /inventaris/aset/{id}/riwayat-kondisi
Controller -> ModelRK  : Query riwayat kondisi aset
ModelRK -> DB          : SELECT riwayat_kondisi WHERE aset_id = ?
DB      --> ModelRK    : Data riwayat kondisi
ModelRK --> Controller : Data riwayat kondisi
Controller --> Browser : Data riwayat kondisi
Browser --> Admin      : Tampil timeline riwayat kondisi

@enduml
